# Generated files whose bytes are hashed: Crest.html's Content-Security-Policy carries the SHA-256 of its inline
# script, and the desktop bundle's index.html carries Subresource Integrity hashes of its assets. A line-ending
# conversion on checkout (Windows, core.autocrlf) would change the bytes and the browser would refuse to run them.
Crest.html -text
crest-desktop/crest/web/** -text
